{"title": "Slayer's Extra Attack", "pageid": 36861, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Slayer's_Extra_Attack", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the base version of the passive used in Slayer form. For the improved version granted at level 10, see <a href=\"/wiki/Slayer%27s_Improved_Extra_Attack\" title=\"Slayer's Improved Extra Attack\">Slayer's Improved Extra Attack</a>. For the normal class feature, see <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a>.  </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Extra_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Extra_Attack.webp/300px-Extra_Attack.webp, /w/images/d/d5/Extra_Attack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Extra_Attack.webp/300px-Extra_Attack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Extra_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Slayer's Extra Attack</b> is a passive feature available to the <a href=\"/wiki/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer</a>, granting it two additional attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can make one additional attack after attacking with your main-hand weapon. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Normally, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a> only works with actions which use weapon or unarmed <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>, but this version of the feature is triggered by any of the Slayer's unique abilities which consume <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Actions</a>, even the ones that are not attacks. These are:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Slayer)\" title=\"Multiattack (Slayer)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Multiattack_Slayer_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Slayer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Multiattack_Slayer_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Slayer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Multiattack_Slayer_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Slayer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Multiattack_Slayer_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Slayer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Multiattack_Slayer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Slayer)\" title=\"Multiattack (Slayer)\">Multiattack</a> - <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slay\" title=\"Slay\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp/25px-Slay_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp/38px-Slay_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp/50px-Slay_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slay\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp/25px-Slay_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slay\" title=\"Slay\">Slay</a> - <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Let_the_Slaughter_Begin\" title=\"Let the Slaughter Begin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Let_the_Slaughter_Begin_Icon.webp/25px-Let_the_Slaughter_Begin_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Let_the_Slaughter_Begin_Icon.webp/38px-Let_the_Slaughter_Begin_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Let_the_Slaughter_Begin_Icon.webp/50px-Let_the_Slaughter_Begin_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Let the Slaughter Begin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Let_the_Slaughter_Begin_Icon.webp/25px-Let_the_Slaughter_Begin_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Let_the_Slaughter_Begin_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Let_the_Slaughter_Begin\" title=\"Let the Slaughter Begin\">Let the Slaughter Begin</a> - <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Constitution Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath\" title=\"Sumptuous Blood Bath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp/25px-Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp/38px-Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp/50px-Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sumptuous Blood Bath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp/25px-Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath\" title=\"Sumptuous Blood Bath\">Sumptuous Blood Bath</a> - <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Constitution Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>While the non-attack roll actions trigger Slayer's Extra Attack, they <em>cannot</em> be used as the free follow up attack. In order to use them with Slayer's Extra Attack, they must be the initial action. For example, it is possible use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath\" title=\"Sumptuous Blood Bath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp/20px-Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp/30px-Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp/40px-Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sumptuous Blood Bath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp/20px-Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sumptuous_Blood_Bath\" title=\"Sumptuous Blood Bath\">Sumptuous Blood Bath</a> and then <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slay\" title=\"Slay\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp/20px-Slay_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp/30px-Slay_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp/40px-Slay_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slay\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp/20px-Slay_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slay\" title=\"Slay\">Slay</a> as the free Extra Attack action, but not vice versa.</li>\n<li>At level 10, this passive grants two additional attacks.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The in-game description for this passive is copied from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slayer%27s_Improved_Extra_Attack\" title=\"Slayer's Improved Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slayer's Improved Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slayer%27s_Improved_Extra_Attack\" title=\"Slayer's Improved Extra Attack\">Slayer's Improved Extra Attack</a> and states that it grants two additional attacks, but it actually only grants one. It also does not require an attack with a main-hand weapon.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202036\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2812/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25021/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14236/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 121/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1287454/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.390      1 -total\n 99.03%   61.782      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 35.19%   21.954      2 Template:SmPass\n 32.60%   20.338     11 Template:Icon_text\n 27.47%   17.138      8 Template:Icon_link\n 24.29%   15.157     22 Template:Trim\n 13.39%    8.353      2 Template:Passive_inline/format\n 11.78%    7.349      4 Template:SAI\n 10.35%    6.455     11 Template:Ifempty\n  8.11%    5.060     11 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:36861-0!canonical and tim